# Territory source spreadsheets. This repository is public; the AE books
# carry named-customer ARR, renewal dates and lost deal values. They are
# read from a local path by db/load-territory.mjs and belong in Postgres
# behind the app's auth, never in git. Ignored by extension so dropping
# one into the repo directory to run the loader can't become a commit.
*.xlsx
*.xlsm
*.xls
*.csv

